Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_x_7.\" title=\"9 x 7.\">9 x 7.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.\" title=\"Cows are made of milk.\">Cows are made of milk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thompson.\" title=\"Thompson.\">Thompson.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hey_mate.\" title=\"Hey mate.\">Hey mate.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">Bats, bats, hang up.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">Is that number got curves?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.\" title=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\">Drier than you think, chalk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Am_I_an_idiom%3F\" title=\"Am I an idiom?\">Am I an idiom?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.\" title=\"A 1970s camping kettle.\">A 1970s camping kettle.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Supping from the fountain.</strong></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Supping from the fountain.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f9/Supping_from_the_fountain..png/revision/latest?cb=20251113230247\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Supping from the fountain.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f9/Supping_from_the_fountain..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251113230247\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f9/Supping_from_the_fountain..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251113230247 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f9/Supping_from_the_fountain..png/revision/latest?cb=20251113230247 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Supping from the fountain.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Supping_from_the_fountain..png\" data-image-name=\"Supping from the fountain..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.\" title=\"A 1970s camping kettle.\">A 1970s camping kettle.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_that_on_my_gravestone.\" title=\"Put that on my gravestone.\">Put that on my gravestone.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Supping from the fountain.</b></i> is the tenth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 13 November 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> observes that he didn’t need to be \"Supping from the fountain\", at the end of his attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Drink_almost_all_the_apple_juice\" title=\"Drink almost all the apple juice\">Drink almost all the apple juice</a> task. The title card shows a mug with a straw in it, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Drink_almost_all_the_apple_juice\" title=\"Drink almost all the apple juice\">Drink almost all the apple juice</a> task and the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_exactly_the_same-looking_drinks_as_your_teammate%27s_drinks\" title=\"Make exactly the same-looking drinks as your teammate&#39;s drinks\">Make exactly the same-looking drinks as your teammate's drinks</a> task. Though unlikely, this could also be a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_water_squirt_out_of_you_in_a_surprising_way\" title=\"Make water squirt out of you in a surprising way\">Make water squirt out of you in a surprising way</a> task.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>As the closest-ever series of Taskmaster reaches its sparkling grand final, all five contestants are still in with a genuine chance of getting their hands on the revered trophy. In the mad dash to the finish line, <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> worries about leaving <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> unattended, <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> gets apple juice in her ear, <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> tries out a new nose and <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> loses his temper over the word 'flanks'. With mutiny in the air, <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> gets drenched multiple times, before <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> crowns the new champion.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/10/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_tube\" title=\"Best tube\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best tube.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_exactly_the_same-looking_drinks_as_your_teammate%27s_drinks\" title=\"Make exactly the same-looking drinks as your teammate&#39;s drinks\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Make exactly the same-looking drinks as your teammate's drinks. Your entire team may only open two doors.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Drink_almost_all_the_apple_juice\" title=\"Drink almost all the apple juice\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drink almost all the apple juice. You must not touch the cup and the cup must not move.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_water_squirt_out_of_you_in_a_surprising_way\" title=\"Make water squirt out of you in a surprising way\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make water squirt out of you in a surprising way. Alex will guess whence the water will squirt. For every incorrect guess, you may squirt him for one second at the end of the task.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Respond_to_the_Taskmaster_correctly\" title=\"Respond to the Taskmaster correctly\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Respond to the Taskmaster correctly. When he says \"wibble\", you say \"bibble\". When he says \"bibble\", you say \"bam\". When he says \"bam\", you say \"wibble bibble bam\". If you dither or err, you are eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/How_many_letter_Ts_are_there_in_the_portrait_of_Alex_and_Greg_in_the_living_room%3F\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"How many letter Ts are there in the portrait of Alex and Greg in the living room?\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> How many letter Ts are there in the portrait of Alex and Greg in the living room?\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>Supping from the fountain.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The contestants were dressed up as pirates for the studio segments of this episode. The costumes were designed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/patrickjack\">Patrick Jack</a>.  On the Official Taskmaster Podcast, Maisie indicated that they were inspired by the concept of the contestants engaging in a \"mutiny\" against Greg and Alex's demands, but that was edited out of the broadcast version.\n<ul><li>The five contestant's outfits are based on fictional pirates from pop culture:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> is dressed as Mr. Smee from <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Pan_(1953_film)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Peter Pan (1953 film)\">Peter Pan</a></i>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> is dressed as Jim Hawkings from <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treasure_Island\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Treasure Island\">Treasure Island</a></i>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> is dressed as Captain Hook from <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hook_(film)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Hook (film)\">Hook</a></i>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> is dressed as Jack Sparrow from <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pirates_of_the_Caribbean\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Pirates of the Caribbean\">Pirates of the Caribbean</a></i>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a>'s outfit is unknown.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Swedish Taskmaster <a href=\"/wiki/Babben_Larsson\" title=\"Babben Larsson\">Babben Larsson</a> was in the audience for this episode.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920125638\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1038/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27198/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 928/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip 